WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Connect via EDA
Live EDA lab; connector installed. Credential entry and provisioning are omitted.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Review the capture profile
The temporary broker and exporter leave the original producer unchanged.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Connect and open the topic
Select the exported topic from the generated connection.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Read an exported record
Inspect its content; a visible event is evidence for this capture only.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Retain the record position
Keep the topic, partition, offset and timestamp for follow-up.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Disconnect the client
Disconnecting Kafka leaves the temporary capture running.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Remove the temporary capture
Removal discards captured messages. Confirm cleanup; the original exporter remains.
